  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A landscaper uses a hose that puts <math alttext=\"88 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>88</mn>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> ounces of water in a bucket in <math alttext=\"5 y\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> minutes. Which expression represents the number of ounces of water the hose puts in the bucket in <math alttext=\"9 y\"><mrow>\n\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> minutes at this rate?</p>",
